<view class="page-shell quiz-page"><view class="eyebrow">趣味自我探索 · 约2分钟</view><view class="title">{{title}}</view><block wx:if="{{!started}}"><view class="intro-art"><text>✦</text><view>留白 / 陪伴 / 探索 / 秩序</view></view><view class="intro">跟着此刻的偏好选择，不需要猜哪一个答案更好。完成8道题，领取你的充电方式卡。</view><button style="width:100%" class="primary-button wide" bindtap="start">开始测试</button><view class="note">这是趣味偏好测试，不是心理诊断。答案仅在当前页面使用，不随结果分享。</view></block><block wx:else><view class="progress-row"><text>问题 {{index + 1}} / {{total}}</text><text>按此刻的感受选择</text></view><view class="progress"><view style="width:{{(index + 1) / total * 100}}%"></view></view><view class="question">{{question.title}}</view><button wx:for="{{question.options}}" wx:key="*this" style="width:100%" class="option {{selected === index ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="choose"><text class="option-number">{{index + 1}}</text><text>{{item}}</text><text wx:if="{{selected === index}}">✓</text></button><view class="quiz-actions"><button wx:if="{{index > 0}}" class="ghost-button" bindtap="previous">上一题</button><button class="primary-button" disabled="{{selected < 0}}" bindtap="next">{{index === total - 1 ? '查看我的结果' : '下一题'}}</button></view><view class="note">可以返回修改选择；中途离开页面会结束本次作答。</view></block></view>
